<title>USA: Ultrak Inc to buy back up to 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Ultrak Inc to buy back up to 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLLTON, Texas 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultrak Inc said Tuesday that its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the shares will be held for general corporate purposes and that its long-term goal is to repurchase its shares from time to time rather than to pay cash dividends.</p>
<p>The company, which makes and services closed-circuit television products for security and surveillance, said such a goal should improve earnings per share by cutting the number of outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
